<title>FINLAND: Finland Bank reserves rise FIM 1.16 bln in week.</title>
<headline>Finland Bank reserves rise FIM 1.16 bln in week.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest balance sheet for the week to July 8 showed the following positions in millions of markka compared to June 30.</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 60,275	59,111</p>
<p> Money market intervention     8,679	 9,558</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		1,921	 1,921</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 1,908	 1,909</p>
<p> Other				 8,189	 8,111</p>
<p> Total assets		     80,972	80,610</p>
<p>In the week to June 30, reserves fell by 89 million markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
